l server. It sends sign-in codes, account e-mails and notifications, unless SnapKhata Settings > Mail has its own server switched on for them.","gen.enabled":"Use this mail server","gen.enabledHint":"When off, mail uses the server in the configuration file, which has no login.","gen.host":"Server (host)","gen.port":"Port","gen.security":"Security","gen.sec.starttls":"STARTTLS (port 587)","gen.sec.ssl":"SSL/TLS (port 465)","gen.sec.none":"None","gen.user":"User name","gen.password":"Password","gen.passwordKeep":"A password is saved. Leave empty to keep it.","gen.passwordNone":"No password saved yet.","gen.fromName":"Sender name","gen.fromAddress":"Sender e-mail","gen.save":"Save","gen.saving":"Saving…","gen.test":"Send test e-mail","gen.loading":"Loading…","gen.wa.h":"WhatsApp","gen.wa.lead":"The WhatsApp Business account (Meta Cloud API) every app sends WhatsApp messages with, such as My Tasks reminders. Messages go out as your approved template, whose body has one variable {{1}} for the text.","gen.wa.enabledHint":"When off, no WhatsApp message is sent.","gen.wa.phoneId":"Phone number ID","gen.wa.accountId":"WhatsApp Business account ID","gen.wa.optional":"Optional","gen.wa.token":"Access token","gen.wa.tokenKeep":"A token is saved. Leave empty to keep it.","gen.wa.tokenNone":"No token saved yet.","gen.wa.version":"Graph API version","gen.wa.template":"Message template name","gen.wa.templateHint":"Approved in WhatsApp Manager; its body is {{1}}","gen.wa.language":"Template language code","gen.wa.testTo":"Mobile number for a test","gen.wa.test":"Send test message","gen.ql.h":"Quick logins","gen.ql.lead":"Users shown as one-tap logins on the login page, for testing. A tap logs in as that user without typing the password, so add only test accounts and keep this list empty on live sites. No password is stored for it: it is a switch on the user.","gen.ql.email":"E-mail of an existing user","gen.ql.add":"Show on login page","gen.ql.remove":"Remove","gen.ql.removeOne":"Re