        ('khata', N'{"seo.khata.title":"{page:khata}: Free Digital Udhar Khata (Credit Ledger)","seo.khata.desc":"Track who owes you and whom you owe. Add entries in seconds, keep separate books in any money type, safe behind your login. Works on phone and PC.","khata.app.name":"{page:khata}","khata.app.book":"Book","khata.app.chooseBook":"Choose a book","khata.app.manageBooks":"Manage books…","khata.app.menu":"{page:khata} menu","khata.app.profile":"Profile","khata.back":"Back","khata.save":"Save","khata.cancel":"Cancel","khata.close":"Close","khata.loading":"Loading…","khata.l.h1":"{page:khata}: your free digital udhar khata","khata.l.lead":"Write down every \"you gave\" and \"you got\", see each customer''s balance at a glance, and keep your khata safe behind your login.","khata.l.open":"Open {page:khata}","khata.l.login":"Log in","khata.l.featuresH":"What you can do","khata.l.f1":"Keep customers and suppliers, each with a running balance.","khata.l.f2":"Add \"you gave\" and \"you got\" entries in seconds, with a date and a note.","khata.l.f3":"Separate books, each in its own money type: rupee, dirham, dollar or your own.","khata.l.f4":"One thakurg.com account for every app: only you can open your books.","khata.l.f5":"Every change is kept in the history, so the ledger can always be trusted.","khata.l.faqH":"Questions","khata.l.q1":"Is {page:khata} free?","khata.l.q1a":"Yes. Adding contacts and entries is free.","khata.l.q2":"How do I log in?","khata.l.q2a":"With the e-mail address and password of your thakurg.com account. Signing up is free.","khata.l.q3":"Can an entry be changed later?","khata.l.q3a":"Yes, by whoever added it. The old version stays in the history.","khata.l.q4":"Is my data private?","khata.l.q4a":"Only you can see your books after logging in.","khata.book.firstTitle":"Create your first book","khata.book.firstLead":"A book is one khata, for example your shop. You can add more books later.","khata.book.name":"Book name","khata.book.defaultName":"